title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/log:toggle
catalog: GUI command
target: log:toggle
summary: Log: toggle a view flag (branch graph / the watcher’s revisions / the selected revision’s operations)

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``log`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``enter`` → ``log:toggle ops`` (in the ``log`` panel)
* ``shift+g`` → ``log:toggle graph`` (in the ``log`` panel)
* ``shift+w`` → ``log:toggle watcher`` (in the ``log`` panel)
